# Testing

- vitest only; colocated `_tests/`; DB tests use mongodb-memory-server **replset**; fake adapters for integrations.
- Business-rule changes get a test; bug fixes get a failing-first regression test; core changes get core-fixture tests.
- Never weaken or skip a test to get green; report failures.

